-- title: Central certificate expiring
-- severity: Medium
-- host: {central_url}
-- minimum_days_left: 14
-- timeout: 10
-- pending_for: 900
-- resolve_after: 1800
-- runbook_url: https://github.com/frappe/central/blob/develop/beacon/runbooks/central-certificate.md
-- Beacon reads the certificate that Central serves. When it expires, no customer can reach the dashboard or the API. Desk sets the Regions to the Central Telemetry Region.
